        "node_id": "n_2_93902b",
        "thought_text": "Revised Thought-1: Instead of trying to fit all preparation into the earliest available days, use a priority queue to always select the exam that requires the least remaining preparation time. This ensures that Petya makes the most efficient use of his preparation days. Additionally, maintain a list of free days and assign preparation days from these free slots whenever possible.",
