        "node_id": "n_3_53e308",
        "thought_text": "Revised Thought-1: Instead of using a priority queue to always process the exam with the earliest deadline for preparation, prioritize exams based on their start day and ensure that Petya has enough time to prepare before the exam day. This approach helps in managing the preparation timeline effectively and ensures that Petya does not run out of days to prepare for an exam. Additionally, maintain a check to see if there are enough days available for preparation before attempting to assign an exam to a day.",
